<title>THAILAND: Ch Karnchang to issue 2.5 bln baht debt.</title>
<headline>Ch Karnchang to issue 2.5 bln baht debt.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ch Karnchang Plc said on Tuesday it would offer up to 2.5 billion baht of unsecured debentures with a maturity of not more than five years.</p>
<p>Ch Karnchang said some or all of the debentures would be offered to local and/or foreign institutional investors.</p>
<p>Further details will be determined by the board of directors.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
